---
id: episodic.distill
description: Distills recent chat messages about a grid or organization into durable, still-true lessons for episodic memory.
owner: ops
component: anansi_app
overridable: true
model: fast
output: text
sections: []
variables: [anchor_name, messages_text, target_words]
access:
  view: [ops, eng]
  edit: [ops]
  publish: [ops]
---
Below are recent support and operations messages about {{anchor_name}}.

{{messages_text}}

Write a distilled understanding of {{anchor_name}} in about {{target_words}} words. Capture durable, still-true facts: recurring faults, equipment quirks, decisions taken and why, and anything a technician arriving today would need to know.

This is not a transcript or a summary of the conversation. Omit anything resolved, superseded, or specific to one exchange. Write plain prose with no preamble.
